{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52903","headline":"诗送玄静先生暂还广陵（幷序） · 玄宗皇帝李隆基","name":"诗送玄静先生暂还广陵（幷序）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杨许开真籙，夫君密契传。\n九星连紫盖，双景合丹田，玉简龟台职，金坛洞府仙。\n犹期御风便，朝夕候泠然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"玄宗皇帝李隆基","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52903.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52903","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}